{"_note":"首页「年视图」:仓库提交(GraphQL 按天 history,本地日历日)+ GitHub 贡献日历。**由 tools/infosource/gen_github_todo.py 生成,不要手改**。\n为什么不用 REST stats/commit_activity 见 year_common 的文档串;按天片段为什么由页面生成见 build_year。","version":1,"actions":[{"op":"set","props":{"key":"t0","value":"${@time.nowMs}"}},{"id":"cred","action":"credential.state","params":{"id":"gh"},"_note":"`fp` 拼进缓存键:换了账号不能先渲出上一个账号的年视图。"},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"fp","value":"$[connect::(${cred.fp},)]"}},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"DAYS","value":"${days}"},"_note":"入参先落地(方法参数与模板里看不见 flow 入参)。页面生成,形如 d0:history(since:\\\"…\\\"){totalCount} …"},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"QD","value":"${qd}"}},{"_note":"入参必须先 op:set 落地成 data 域的键,方法参数里才看得见(§9.5 #3)。`.xwidget` 不传 → 空串 → 归 0 → 全程不碰缓存。","op":"set","props":{"key":"cacheIn","value":"${_cache}"}},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"useCache","value":"$[parseNumber::(${cacheIn},0)]"}},{"_note":"**结构版本号**:pack 的字段集变了就 +1。它管的不是「数据新不新」而是「这份数据的**形状**还认不认」——缓存键只含对象维度、不含包代际,不盖这个戳,升级后首屏就会拿上一版的 pack 去渲新模板:少的字段取空,尺寸串里的 calc 一算 null,**整卡白块且不报错**。\n⚠️ 从 1 起、绝不能用 0(`eq::(空,0)` 恒为 true,旧缓存会被判成匹配)。⚠️ 刻意不用 `manifest.version`:flow 拿不到,且那会过度失效(只改配色也丢全部缓存)。","op":"set","props":{"key":"SCHEMA","value":"1"}},{"_note":"缓存键。⚠️ 凡是影响结果的入参都要进键,且**绝不能用下标**(下标随增删漂移,漂移后会把 A 的数据渲成 B 的,还不报错)。","op":"set","props":{"key":"ckey","value":"$[connect::(c.gh.year.,${fp})]"}},{"_note":"读缓存。`default:{}` 让下面的 ${hit.ts} 在无缓存时安全取空,而不是整条流断掉。","id":"hit","action":"data.get","params":{"key":"${ckey}","default":{}}},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"hitSchema","value":"${hit.schema}"}},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"nowMs","value":"${@time.nowMs}"}},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"hitTs","value":"$[parseNumber::(${hit.ts},0)]"}},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"age","value":"$[calc::(${nowMs}-${hitTs})]"}},{"_note":"两道闸:**结构比对**(pack 形状对不上就当没有缓存 —— 旧形状渲新模板是白块,比等一次网络糟得多)+ hardTTL = 604800s(太旧的数先渲出来再改口,不如老实等一次)。嵌套 if 而不是 and:: —— `and` 不在确认可用的方法集里。","op":"set","props":{"key":"hasHit","value":"$[if::(eq::(${hitSchema},${SCHEMA}),if::(gt::(${hitTs},0),if::(lt::(${age},604800000),1,0),0),0)]"}},{"_note":"ttl = 3600s(§5.5.3)。纯新鲜度,不掺 useCache —— 掺进去 `_stale` 就算不对了。","op":"set","props":{"key":"fresh","value":"$[if::(gt::(${hitTs},0),if::(lt::(${age},3600000),1,0),0)]"}},{"_note":"「这次先出的是旧货,请后台校新」。**必须进 resultFilter** —— 校新那条路靠它,漏了就是永不校新。","op":"set","props":{"key":"_stale","value":"$[if::(eq::(${useCache},1),if::(eq::(${hasHit},1),if::(eq::(${fresh},1),0,1),0),0)]"}},{"_note":"只有「开了缓存 且 有没超 hardTTL 的货」才跳过网络 —— 连接都不建立。⚠️ **stale 也走这条跳过**(首屏零等待是三态的全部价值);写成「不 fresh 就打」= 退回两态,首屏照样白等。卡片(useCache=0)与冷启一律落进 items 真取数。","op":"if","props":{"val":"$[if::(eq::(${useCache},1),if::(eq::(${hasHit},1),0,1),1)]"},"items":[{"op":"set","props":{"key":"hdr","value":{"Accept":"application/json","Content-Type":"application/json","User-Agent":"Numable"}}},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"body","value":"{\"query\": \"query{viewer{login repositories(first:6,orderBy:{field:PUSHED_AT,direction:DESC},ownerAffiliations:[OWNER],isFork:false,isArchived:false){nodes{nameWithOwner}} contributionsCollection{contributionCalendar{totalContributions weeks{contributionDays{contributionCount date}}}}}}\"}"}},{"_note":"GraphQL 出错恒返 200、错误在 errors[] 里;没绑 / 令牌失效时是 401。两种情况下 data.viewer 都取不到 → 下面 ok=0,不会假绿。","id":"q","action":"request","params":{"url":"https://api.github.com/graphql","method":"POST","header":"${hdr}","body":"${body}","formatType":"json","credential":"gh"}},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"_b","value":"1"},"_note":"⚠️ 请求/并发屏障(勿删):request 与 concurrent 之后**紧邻**的节点读不到响应(晚一拍合并,memory [[actionflow-concurrent-late-merge]])。删掉它 → 下面所有 index:: 静默取空 → 卡渲一片 `--`,而流仍报 success。"},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"login","value":"${q.data.viewer.login}"}},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"ok","value":"$[if::(or::(eq::(connect::(k,${login}),k)),0,1)]"},"_note":"判据是 **viewer 有没有回来**,不是任何计数:待办恰好全是 0 是好消息,拿计数判会把「今天很干净」误判成「没取到」。⚠️ 用 `connect::(k,…)` 哨兵拼串再比 —— `eq` 是数字化比较,`eq::(0,)` 恒真(todo.df 2026-08-26 栽过)。\n⚠️ 还要求本条流用到的每一段都回来了(need):GraphQL 部分超时会只让某几个 search 为 null、viewer 照常返回 —— 只看 viewer 会把「没取到」渲成「都处理完了」,提醒也会判假而不是未知(2026-09-25 审查实证)。"},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"p0","value":"$[findNotEmpty::(${q.data.viewer.repositories.nodes[0].nameWithOwner},)]"}},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"h0","value":"$[if::(eq::(connect::(k,${p0}),k),0,1)]"}},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"o0","value":"$[replaceAll::(${p0},/.*$,)]"}},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"n0","value":"$[replaceAll::(${p0},^.*/,)]"}},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"b0","value":"{\"query\":\"query{r:repository(owner:\\\"${o0}\\\",name:\\\"${n0}\\\"){defaultBranchRef{target{...on Commit{${DAYS}}}}}}\"}"}},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"p1","value":"$[findNotEmpty::(${q.data.viewer.repositories.nodes[1].nameWithOwner},)]"}},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"h1","value":"$[if::(eq::(connect::(k,${p1}),k),0,1)]"}},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"o1","value":"$[replaceAll::(${p1},/.*$,)]"}},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"n1","value":"$[replaceAll::(${p1},^.*/,)]"}},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"b1","value":"{\"query\":\"query{r:repository(owner:\\\"${o1}\\\",name:\\\"${n1}\\\"){defaultBranchRef{target{...on Commit{${DAYS}}}}}}\"}"}},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"p2","value":"$[findNotEmpty::(${q.data.viewer.repositories.nodes[2].nameWithOwner},)]"}},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"h2","value":"$[if::(eq::(connect::(k,${p2}),k),0,1)]"}},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"o2","value":"$[replaceAll::(${p2},/.*$,)]"}},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"n2","value":"$[replaceAll::(${p2},^.*/,)]"}},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"b2","value":"{\"query\":\"query{r:repository(owner:\\\"${o2}\\\",name:\\\"${n2}\\\"){defaultBranchRef{target{...on Commit{${DAYS}}}}}}\"}"}},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"p3","value":"$[findNotEmpty::(${q.data.viewer.repositories.nodes[3].nameWithOwner},)]"}},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"h3","value":"$[if::(eq::(connect::(k,${p3}),k),0,1)]"}},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"o3","value":"$[replaceAll::(${p3},/.*$,)]"}},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"n3","value":"$[replaceAll::(${p3},^.*/,)]"}},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"b3","value":"{\"query\":\"query{r:repository(owner:\\\"${o3}\\\",name:\\\"${n3}\\\"){defaultBranchRef{target{...on Commit{${DAYS}}}}}}\"}"}},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"p4","value":"$[findNotEmpty::(${q.data.viewer.repositories.nodes[4].nameWithOwner},)]"}},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"h4","value":"$[if::(eq::(connect::(k,${p4}),k),0,1)]"}},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"o4","value":"$[replaceAll::(${p4},/.*$,)]"}},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"n4","value":"$[replaceAll::(${p4},^.*/,)]"}},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"b4","value":"{\"query\":\"query{r:repository(owner:\\\"${o4}\\\",name:\\\"${n4}\\\"){defaultBranchRef{target{...on Commit{${DAYS}}}}}}\"}"}},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"p5","value":"$[findNotEmpty::(${q.data.viewer.repositories.nodes[5].nameWithOwner},)]"}},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"h5","value":"$[if::(eq::(connect::(k,${p5}),k),0,1)]"}},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"o5","value":"$[replaceAll::(${p5},/.*$,)]"}},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"n5","value":"$[replaceAll::(${p5},^.*/,)]"}},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"b5","value":"{\"query\":\"query{r:repository(owner:\\\"${o5}\\\",name:\\\"${n5}\\\"){defaultBranchRef{target{...on Commit{${DAYS}}}}}}\"}"}},{"action":"concurrent","items":[{"op":"if","props":{"val":"${h0}"},"items":[{"id":"g0","action":"request","params":{"url":"https://api.github.com/graphql","method":"POST","header":"${hdr}","body":"${b0}","formatType":"json","credential":"gh"}}]},{"op":"if","props":{"val":"${h1}"},"items":[{"id":"g1","action":"request","params":{"url":"https://api.github.com/graphql","method":"POST","header":"${hdr}","body":"${b1}","formatType":"json","credential":"gh"}}]},{"op":"if","props":{"val":"${h2}"},"items":[{"id":"g2","action":"request","params":{"url":"https://api.github.com/graphql","method":"POST","header":"${hdr}","body":"${b2}","formatType":"json","credential":"gh"}}]},{"op":"if","props":{"val":"${h3}"},"items":[{"id":"g3","action":"request","params":{"url":"https://api.github.com/graphql","method":"POST","header":"${hdr}","body":"${b3}","formatType":"json","credential":"gh"}}]},{"op":"if","props":{"val":"${h4}"},"items":[{"id":"g4","action":"request","params":{"url":"https://api.github.com/graphql","method":"POST","header":"${hdr}","body":"${b4}","formatType":"json","credential":"gh"}}]},{"op":"if","props":{"val":"${h5}"},"items":[{"id":"g5","action":"request","params":{"url":"https://api.github.com/graphql","method":"POST","header":"${hdr}","body":"${b5}","formatType":"json","credential":"gh"}}]}]},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"_gb","value":"1"},"_note":"⚠️ 请求/并发屏障(勿删):request 与 concurrent 之后**紧邻**的节点读不到响应(晚一拍合并,memory [[actionflow-concurrent-late-merge]])。删掉它 → 下面所有 index:: 静默取空 → 卡渲一片 `--`,而流仍报 success。"},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"tg0","value":"${g0.data.r.defaultBranchRef.target}"},"_note":"⚠️ 不能叫 t{i}:t0 是「现在」的时间戳,覆盖掉它时效锚就渲空了(2026-09-25 栽过)。"},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"k0","value":"$[if::(eq::(${h0},1),if::(ge::(length::(${g0.data}),1),1,0),1)]"},"_note":"判「请求回来了」看 data 不看 target:空仓库(刚建、没推过代码)的 defaultBranchRef 是 null,它按推送时间恰恰排最前 —— 拿 target 判,这张组件会一直失败到用户推代码为止(审查实证)。"},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"tg1","value":"${g1.data.r.defaultBranchRef.target}"}},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"k1","value":"$[if::(eq::(${h1},1),if::(ge::(length::(${g1.data}),1),1,0),1)]"}},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"tg2","value":"${g2.data.r.defaultBranchRef.target}"}},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"k2","value":"$[if::(eq::(${h2},1),if::(ge::(length::(${g2.data}),1),1,0),1)]"}},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"tg3","value":"${g3.data.r.defaultBranchRef.target}"}},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"k3","value":"$[if::(eq::(${h3},1),if::(ge::(length::(${g3.data}),1),1,0),1)]"}},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"tg4","value":"${g4.data.r.defaultBranchRef.target}"}},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"k4","value":"$[if::(eq::(${h4},1),if::(ge::(length::(${g4.data}),1),1,0),1)]"}},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"tg5","value":"${g5.data.r.defaultBranchRef.target}"}},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"k5","value":"$[if::(eq::(${h5},1),if::(ge::(length::(${g5.data}),1),1,0),1)]"}},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"_k","value":["${k0}","${k1}","${k2}","${k3}","${k4}","${k5}"]}},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"_kb","value":"1"},"_note":"⚠️ 请求/并发屏障(勿删):request 与 concurrent 之后**紧邻**的节点读不到响应(晚一拍合并,memory [[actionflow-concurrent-late-merge]])。删掉它 → 下面所有 index:: 静默取空 → 卡渲一片 `--`,而流仍报 success。"},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"done","value":"$[if::(eq::(sum::(${_k}),6),1,0)]"},"_note":"6 个仓库都拿到了才算完整;不完整不写缓存。"},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"login","value":"${q.data.viewer.login}"}},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"ctot","value":"${q.data.viewer.contributionsCollection.contributionCalendar.totalContributions}"}},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"cal","value":"$[pluck::(${q.data.viewer.contributionsCollection.contributionCalendar.weeks},contributionDays)]"}},{"_note":"写回哨兵:**直接取响应字段,不加任何兜底** —— 取数失败/响应变形时它必空。别拿加工后的显示字段当判据,那些几乎都带兜底,拦不住任何东西。","op":"set","props":{"key":"_guard","value":"$[if::(eq::(${done},1),${q.data.viewer.login},)]"}},{"_note":"整份渲染输入打包落盘。⚠️ 键集必须与 resultFilter 完全一致 —— 少一个,命中缓存那趟就少一个字段(而且不报错)。","op":"set","props":{"key":"pack","value":{"ok":"${ok}","login":"${login}","done":"${done}","ctot":"${ctot}","cal":"${cal}","QD":"${QD}","p0":"${p0}","p1":"${p1}","p2":"${p2}","p3":"${p3}","p4":"${p4}","p5":"${p5}","tg0":"${tg0}","tg1":"${tg1}","tg2":"${tg2}","tg3":"${tg3}","tg4":"${tg4}","tg5":"${tg5}","ts":"${nowMs}","schema":"${SCHEMA}"}}},{"_note":"契约 4(§5.5.2):关键字段非空才写回。`_guard` 在取数失败/响应变形时必空 —— 此时什么都不写,盘上的旧货留着继续渲。一次超时把 pack 写成空,就把这页永久钉死在空态上直到下次恰好成功。","op":"if","props":{"val":"$[if::(gt::(length::(${_guard}),0),1,0)]"},"items":[{"action":"data.set","params":{"key":"${ckey}","value":"${pack}"}}]}]},{"_note":"统一出口:走没走网络都从缓存对象取渲染输入 —— 两条路径只有一份字段映射,不会出现「命中那条少算一个字段」的分叉。","id":"box","action":"data.get","params":{"key":"${ckey}","default":{}}},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"ok","value":"${box.ok}"}},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"login","value":"${box.login}"}},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"done","value":"${box.done}"}},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"ctot","value":"${box.ctot}"}},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"cal","value":"${box.cal}"}},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"QD","value":"${box.QD}"}},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"p0","value":"${box.p0}"}},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"p1","value":"${box.p1}"}},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"p2","value":"${box.p2}"}},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"p3","value":"${box.p3}"}},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"p4","value":"${box.p4}"}},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"p5","value":"${box.p5}"}},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"tg0","value":"${box.tg0}"}},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"tg1","value":"${box.tg1}"}},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"tg2","value":"${box.tg2}"}},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"tg3","value":"${box.tg3}"}},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"tg4","value":"${box.tg4}"}},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"tg5","value":"${box.tg5}"}},{"action":"resultFilter","params":{"keys":["_stale","ckey","ok","login","done","ctot","cal","QD","p0","p1","p2","p3","p4","p5","tg0","tg1","tg2","tg3","tg4","tg5"]},"_note":"resultFilter 恒放最后;少透一个键,下游就是空参。⚠️ `_stale`/`ckey` 是校新那条路的入参,别删。"}]}
